    card type, they add it to their hand. Otherwise, they place it on top of their
    Deck. If this face-up card in its owner''s Spell & Trap Zone is destroyed by
    an opponent''s card effect: You can make your opponent place 1 card from their
    hand on the bottom of the Deck.'
